## Mixed-media example

```ts
timeline.loadData({
  tracks: [
    {
      events: [
        {
          startTime: 0,
          endTime: 100,
          title: "Audio / video event",
          media: {
            images: [
              {
                src: "/thumbnail.jpg",
                fit: "contain",
                opacity: 0.25,
              },
            ],
            waveform: {
              data: audioSamples,
